#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""orb: turn a branch into a live preview (an Orb) on an Instabox machine.

  orb up <repo> <branch>   create or reuse the Orb, start the stack, print URLs and sign-in
  orb verify <orb>         run the repo's verify-<app> journeys against the public URL
  orb panel <orb>          build the review panel and serve it on the second port
  orb status               list Orbs with their URLs (read-only)
  orb down <orb>           save the panel and .verify/ on this Mac, then delete the machine

Machines come from ~/.agents/skills/instabox/box (create + clone) and the instabox CLI.
"""
